```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomousDriving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:FoggyCondition ;
    ex:hasTimeStamp "2023-10-05T14:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime .

ex:FoggyCondition a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:visibilityRange 50 ; # in meters .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType ex:AutonomousCar ;
    ex:position ex:FrontOfScene ;
    ex:hasSensorData ex:LidarCameraData .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType ex:PassengerCar ;
    ex:position ex:FollowingVehicle ;
    ex:color ex:Yellow .

ex:Vehicle3 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:vehicleType ex:PassengerCar ;
    ex:position ex:OppositeLane ;
    ex:color ex:Gray .

ex:RoadInfrastructure1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:roadType ex:UrbanRoad ;
    ex:hasLaneMarkings ex:DoubleWhiteLines ;
    ex:hasTrafficSigns ex:SpeedLimitSign .

ex:Building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:position ex:RightSideOfRoad .

ex:Building2 a ex:Building ;
    ex:position ex:LeftSideOfRoad .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle2 .
ex:Vehicle2 ex:isIn ex:OppositeLaneTo ex:Vehicle3 .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:isApproaching ex:Intersection .
ex:Building1 ex:occludes ex:Vehicle3 .
ex:FoggyCondition ex:reducesVisibilityOf ex:Vehicle3 .
```

---

```plaintext
Identified Risks for each risk class
```

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to foggy conditions, potentially leading to delayed detection of vehicles and infrastructure.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description: Occlusion of the gray vehicle (Vehicle3) by the building (Building1), which could cause the autonomous vehicle (Vehicle1) to miss detecting Vehicle3 until it is too close.
Severity Score: 0.80

**Risk 3:**
Description: Following vehicle (Vehicle2) may not be detected promptly due to fog, increasing the risk of collision if Vehicle1 brakes suddenly.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 4:**
Description: Potential misinterpretation of lane markings due to fog, leading to incorrect lane-keeping behavior by Vehicle1.
Severity Score: 0.70

**Risk 5:**
Description: Intersection visibility is obscured, increasing the risk of Vehicle1 failing to detect oncoming traffic or pedestrians.
Severity Score: 0.85

---
The severity scores are based on a scale from 0 (no risk) to 1 (highest risk), considering the impact on autonomous driving safety. The foggy conditions and occlusion are the primary contributors to the high severity scores in this scenario.